{"4713260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Urine Nation", "steam_appid": 4713260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you've got what it takes to create the <strong>URINE NATION?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the UK and Ireland to famous destinations like <strong> Scunthorpe, Dagenham, Derry </strong>and <strong>more!</strong> Explore the locations and take in a bit of the culture... before you give it a much-needed makeover! Use <strong>ALL</strong> <strong>THE URINE IN YOUR SYSTEM</strong> to drench every inch of the level while completing objectives and gaining crazy combos!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713260/extras/123afbd7d92d0136fc6e152ee839cf5d.poster.avif?t=1786718010\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713260/extras/123afbd7d92d0136fc6e152ee839cf5d.webm?t=1786718010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713260/extras/123afbd7d92d0136fc6e152ee839cf5d.mp4?t=1786718010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock a roster of <strong>PRO'S</strong>, each with their own unique stats, attitude, urine stream! From <strong>TOMMY PORK</strong>, the skater with no respect for authority, to  <strong>WILSON THE DOG</strong>, seeking to mark his territory wherever he lays a paw. There's a URINATOR for everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713260/extras/5fea6aa18e6491b7fc4fe17f582e4a21.poster.avif?t=1786718010\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713260/extras/5fea6aa18e6491b7fc4fe17f582e4a21.webm?t=1786718010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713260/extras/5fea6aa18e6491b7fc4fe17f582e4a21.mp4?t=1786718010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the game your way! Complete as many objectives as possible before time runs out in <strong>ARCADE MODE</strong>. Feel the satisfaction of covering every crevice of the level in urine with <strong>SINGLE SESSION</strong>. Unleash your inner creative within <strong>ARTIST MODE</strong> and create your own whizzing masterpieces!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713260/extras/85c7a3237b366a7cd26a825c4a05777a.poster.avif?t=1786718010\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713260/extras/85c7a3237b366a7cd26a825c4a05777a.webm?t=1786718010\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4713260/extras/85c7a3237b366a7cd26a825c4a05777a.mp4?t=1786718010\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you've got what it takes to create the <strong>URINE NATION?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across the UK and Ireland to famous destinations like <strong> Scunthorpe, Dagenham, Derry </strong>and <strong>more!</strong> Explore the locations and take in a bit of the culture... before you give it a much-needed makeover! Use <strong>ALL</strong> <strong>THE URINE IN YOUR SYSTEM</strong> to drench every inch of the level while completing objectives and gaining crazy combos!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span cla